# Applied patch files shouldn't stay as tracked artifacts (root-level only —
# .yarn/patches/ above is intentionally kept). Two of these ended up
# committed directly (auth-a11y-labeling-fix.patch, uiux-consistency-pass-2.patch)
# and were removed 2026-08-17; this stops it from recurring silently.
/*.patch
